{{unsure}} West African CFA franc used in Senegal has close ties to France. French Cour de Cassation ruled in 2002 that franc is not covered by Copyright Law<ref>[https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/juri/id/JURITEXT000007044201]</ref>, but it is not known if it also applies to West African CFA franc.

